    [*] --> Start: approved draft queued
    Start --> DbRestart: DB connection error
    DbRestart --> Start: retry (backoff max 60s)
    Start --> Route
    Route --> Landmarks: phone montage
    Route --> PhoneHook: phone voiceover montage
    Route --> Analyze: cloud render
    Landmarks --> Unlabelled: guess failed
    Landmarks --> ComposeText: facts ready
    Unlabelled --> ComposeText
    ComposeText --> TextTimeout: both models time out
    ComposeText --> TextFailed: answer unusable
    ComposeText --> PlanFailed: quota / AI error
    ComposeText --> AskSimplify: request can't be met
    ComposeText --> PhoneReady: text composed
    PhoneHook --> HookDegraded: hook AI failed
    PhoneHook --> BadIntro: AI text won't compile
    PhoneHook --> PlanTimeout: provider outcome unknown
    PhoneHook --> PhoneReady: plan compiled
    HookDegraded --> PhoneReady
    Route --> Unsupported: any ValueError on phone
    Route --> CleanupFailed: required cleanup fails
    Analyze --> AnalyzeDegraded: Gemini failed / quota
    Analyze --> SpreadMoments: empty best moments
    Analyze --> Transcribe: clips understood
    AnalyzeDegraded --> Transcribe
    SpreadMoments --> Transcribe
    Transcribe --> TranscriptDegraded: Gemini failed
    Transcribe --> Music: words ready
    TranscriptDegraded --> Music
    Music --> NoSong: no tracks / matcher failed
    Music --> Hook: song picked or not asked
    NoSong --> Hook
    Hook --> HookDegraded: writer refused / failed
    Hook --> Ready: hook written
    HookDegraded --> Ready
    Start --> Timeout: soft limit 1740s
    Start --> Unknown: any other exception
    Start --> Frozen: OOM / deploy kill
    Frozen --> Redelivered: requeued (now, or ~32 min)
    Redelivered --> Start: job starts over
    Frozen --> Lost: message lost
    Lost --> SweepSkipped: 5 min sweep, inspect fails
    SweepSkipped --> Lost: next sweep
    Lost --> Reaped: 60 min, sweep works
    TextTimeout --> [*]: you can retry
    TextFailed --> [*]: you can retry
    PlanTimeout --> [*]: you can retry
    PlanFailed --> [*]: you can retry
    Ready --> [*]
    PhoneReady --> [*]

